# Backend (`backend/`)

- Shape: route handler → service/graph → tools. No business logic dumped in `main.py` beyond parsing and status codes.
- Validate with Pydantic models aligned to `contracts/openapi.yaml`.
- Errors: `{ code, message }` only. Never stack traces, SQL, or internal paths.
- Policy gate on every rollback execution path.
- Structured logs; no PII/token fields.
